# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, K03 NS-ROLES-CALL (docs :668): Model exists, so `Model: b raw` is Model's call, refused by
# its arity.  EXACT DEBT (steps/defects.md#typed-binding-purpose-debt): the letter refused at run time by a Model-typed b.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

receiveMessage: raw
Model: b raw
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 0; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
